## Data Models

### Event (ClickHouse table)
```sql
CREATE TABLE events (
  workspace_id     UUID,
  session_id       UUID,
  user_id          String,
  event_id         UUID,
  event_type       LowCardinality(String),  -- console|network|error|interaction|business
  timestamp        DateTime64(3, 'UTC'),
  sequence_num     UInt64,
  payload          String,   -- JSON
  severity         LowCardinality(String),  -- info|warn|error|critical
  workflow_id      Nullable(String),
  fingerprint      Nullable(String),
  ingested_at      DateTime DEFAULT now()
) ENGINE = MergeTree()
PARTITION BY toYYYYMM(timestamp)
ORDER BY (workspace_id, session_id, timestamp);
```

### Session (ClickHouse table)
```sql
CREATE TABLE sessions (
  workspace_id   UUID,
  session_id     UUID,
  user_id        String,
  started_at     DateTime64(3, 'UTC'),
  ended_at       Nullable(DateTime64(3, 'UTC')),
  url_origin     String,
  user_agent     String,
  incident_count UInt32,
  has_anomaly    UInt8
) ENGINE = MergeTree()
ORDER BY (workspace_id, started_at);
```

